<item>
<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-24T02:26:43.535Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:26:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces continue strikes in Gaza, killing a UNRWA worker and others, while also cutting off vital hearing-aid supplies and approving sewage pumps that will discharge raw waste into the Mediterranean, worsening environmental damage described as a toxic wasteland. In the West Bank, Israeli checkpoints impede ambulance drivers and have become dangerous obstacles, and Israeli raids on refugee camps have led to dozens of detentions. Israeli incursions into southern Syria have triggered fear and destruction, extending the conflict beyond Gaza and the West Bank. The conflict has caused 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168836&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/23/israels-southern-syria-incursion-triggers-fear-and-destruction?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168862&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQb0ZRLVpyV0lTeXM1cEhkSkFZOG80NXdUYjI0dVhUR1NObDg0aDJCSHpFOElJMDZ4clJlNHhqVV9KY3Z1Z3QwTDhoYjRKREt3Q0IxQWl1aktWWmZXdXhfR0RDXzVHc3hlMTFzZXgta0pURTlhaVJPaHFWUGVvUjVsVnZ6dEliQ2dSV3B3SHNjUXhhYmNNOWdZaEFsbUF3VjYzT3ZyUTVGWnppT2t6RWxFaHNnbllKNndfZXk2QWp0TGJEOUM2Vnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPOWFaSmlVazFNOGQxMGVsSjJhS1JqR3J0TURmLWI4SjBpWlU0eXp4dTNYTWF0T2lneHlPUnJJSVpDakxmdlZqNUlWSlJLTnR2TVBSRFZJRHNTaFRhcEh1U3J0b0JiRHRoMmttM1laeFBHYy1pbC1wRzBoUkUzblhTRmp2UWtJdkhrRUZtTURfcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre